# TerraPDF

> A lightweight, zero-dependency, pure C# library for generating PDF 1.7 documents
> programmatically. Fluent API covering page layout, rich text, tables, images,
> vector graphics, barcodes, custom font embedding, and AES-256 encryption.
> MIT licensed. Targets .NET 8, 9, and 10. Current version: {{ site.version }} ({{ site.releaseDate }}).

TerraPDF has no native binaries and no third-party runtime dependencies. Install with
`dotnet add package TerraPDF`. Documents are composed with `Document.Create(...)` and
written with `PublishPdf(...)`.

**If you are an AI agent, fetch {{ site.url }}/llms-full.txt instead of this file.**
It contains the complete API contract plus every guide below, in one request.

